{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"63357367-50d3-4eda-84c2-8575edc40405","workItemId":"PS160-PRODUCTION-EVALUATION-20260817","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-17T03:18:30.697Z","conclusion":{"id":"ac086c6a-17e9-4657-bf01-c20da630f55b","status":"PROVEN","text":"PlanetScale Postgres Single Node 是 1 个 primary、0 个 replica；非 Single 的生产分支默认 2 个 replicas，并跨 3 个可用区，因此标准 HA 为 1 主 2 从、共 3 节点。","evidence":["PlanetScale 2026-08-17 官方 Single node、Database replicas 与 Cluster configuration 文档"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"72f699e4-125f-4a2c-bc65-649e403cda09","workItemId":"PS160-PRODUCTION-EVALUATION-20260817","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-17T03:18:31.063Z","conclusion":{"id":"49f8c97c-a21d-4b31-85b2-95f7cf2581ab","status":"PROVEN","text":"PlanetScale 公开自助配置只说明生产 HA 默认 2 个副本并允许增加额外副本，没有公开 1 主 1 从的双节点 HA 套餐；从 Single 升 HA 时会一次增加 2 个副本。","evidence":["https://planetscale.com/docs/postgres/cluster-configuration/single-node","https://planetscale.com/docs/postgres/scaling/replicas"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"a828d7ee-fa8d-475a-9895-ec824ecd3e0c","workItemId":"PS160-PRODUCTION-EVALUATION-20260817","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-17T03:18:31.435Z","conclusion":{"id":"9a5a4a95-9aaf-495d-86dd-19a3cc3f7819","status":"PROVEN","text":"PS-160 当前公开月价中，AWS ARM Single Node 为 95 美元、HA 为 286 美元；AWS x86 Single Node 为 116 美元、HA 为 349 美元，均未包含网络存储及超额 IOPS、吞吐等费用。","evidence":["https://planetscale.com/docs/postgres/pricing 于 2026-08-17 的公开价格表"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"e1d6a628-4d67-4b17-ae34-4a31e68b0162","workItemId":"PS160-PRODUCTION-EVALUATION-20260817","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-17T03:18:31.819Z","conclusion":{"id":"6c0d9c9d-14db-486f-a83c-0a4c25628a26","status":"INFERRED","text":"标准产品没有双节点档；文档中的可调整副本数结合 replicas 文档实际表示在默认 2 个副本之上增加，而不是把 HA 降到 1 个副本。","evidence":["replicas 文档明确写 may add additional replicas，并将额外副本定义为 beyond the default 2"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"945bd97e-4fda-477d-bbfc-68e84197b33e","workItemId":"PS160-PRODUCTION-EVALUATION-20260817","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-17T03:18:32.206Z","conclusion":{"id":"a0975eed-15c5-4523-af63-94f02849dbaf","status":"PROPOSAL","text":"Kando 若选择 PlanetScale，Single PS-160 仅用于迁移验证、影子流量和压测；全量生产最低候选使用 HA PS-160，并在相同 HA 拓扑上验证复制开销、故障切换和导入期间 OLTP 退化，若 CPU 门槛不通过则升级 HA PS-320。","evidence":["当前数据库承载账号、Session、资产、订阅、目录、当前价与价格历史，Single Node 故障会使整站数据库能力不可用"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"b0ed3264-faa9-428a-ae10-6b4baae130c0","workItemId":"PS160-PRODUCTION-EVALUATION-20260817","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-17T03:18:32.567Z","conclusion":{"id":"4e1fff0b-7adc-4c76-bbf0-bdd1266ff08d","status":"UNKNOWN","text":"Enterprise 或 Managed 合同能否提供非公开的 1 主 1 从定制拓扑，官方公开文档和价格表未承诺，必须向 PlanetScale 销售书面确认。","evidence":["公开产品文档只列 Single Node 与默认 2 replicas 的生产 HA"]}}
